---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Ben and 3DEngelen"
  description="Meet Ben, the maker behind 3DEngelen: a software engineer exploring functional 3D prints, ambitious projects, and practical making."
>
  <div class="page-intro section-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">MAKER PROFILE</p>
    <h1>
      About<span class="accent">.</span>
    </h1>
    <p>A little about the maker behind 3DEngelen.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="about-content section-shell">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / THE MAKER</p>
      <h2>I'm Ben</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      I'm the maker behind 3DEngelen, based in Belgium. What started as a
      3D-printing hobby has grown into a passion for designing, building, and
      experimenting. With a background in software engineering, I enjoy bringing
      technology together with hands-on making.
    </p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / WHAT I MAKE</p>
      <h2>Built to be useful</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      I'm especially interested in functional prints, ambitious projects, and
      creative solutions to practical problems. From small workshop ideas to
      larger builds, I like exploring what modern 3D printers can really do.
    </p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / HOW I WORK</p>
      <h2>Always experimenting</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      I try different materials, machines, and techniques, learning something
      new along the way.
    </p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">04 / WHY I SHARE</p>
      <h2>A workshop journal</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      This site is my workshop journal: a place to share what I build, what I
      learn, and sometimes what goes wrong. If something here inspires you to
      make your own version, then it has done its job.
    </p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">05 / CONTACT</p>
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:3DEngelen@gmail.com">3DEngelen@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
